       requirement.

[completion-04] A test asserts that sibling bullets worded alike under one scope
    exclusions heading receive the same disposition as each other.
    -> sibling-bullets-same-disposition  [invariant/explicit]   (also serves constraint-04)
       Preserve the rule that sibling bullets worded alike under one scope exclusions
       heading receive the same disposition as each other.

[completion-05] A test asserts that a requirement disposed of without an obligation has
    a reason stating no property the change must preserve.
    -> reason-no-preserved-property  [docs_config/explicit]   (also serves constraint-05)
       Produce a reason for no-obligation dispositions that states no property the
